title: Route1RetryStart
tags: cutscene
---
<<declare $r1_retry_again = false>>
// The entry node of box R1Dinner2Retry, started by reaching for her at her door after the
// second dinner (Route1Thu2Reach) or again here (Route1RetryReach). The next evening he is
// in 3B and her text is waiting. $r1_retry_again: he reached for her before in this retry
// (set by Route1RetryReach, cleared by the kiss); it only changes her words.
<<enter_box R1Dinner2Retry>>
<<note_done r1_thu2>>
<<fade_out>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<place Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player right>>
<<if $r1_retry_again>>
    <<card "Another evening.">>
<<else>>
    <<card "The next evening.">>
<<endif>>
<<fade_in>>
<<phone PhoneRetry>>
<<note r1_retry "A text from Samantha.">>
You: Home. And my phone's buzzing.
// The player walks freely from here. Knocking on 3A starts Route1RetryDoor (door_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1RetryDoor
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by knocking on 3A the evening after she sent him home (door_3a.yarn). She stays
// in her doorway and sets him the same test (samantha_3a.yarn).
<<walk Player PlayerTo3A>>
<<face Player right>>
<<wait 1>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<place Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
<<if $r1_retry_again>>
    {$samantha_name}: Back again.
    {$samantha_name}: Same place. Same rule.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Eight o'clock. You came back.
    {$samantha_name}: Did you think about what I said?
    You: You said "not like that."
    {$samantha_name}: I did. Now show me what "like that" is.
<<endif>>
{$samantha_name}: Stand there. Hands by your sides.
{$samantha_name}: Don't move.
<<done R1Dinner2Retry door>>
<<note r1_retry "Stand still.">>
// The player is in control: standing still or reaching for her are actions on her
// (samantha_3a.yarn). Standing still starts Route1RetryKiss, reaching Route1RetryReach.
===
title: Route1RetryKiss
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by standing still at her door the evening after (samantha_3a.yarn). A different
// kiss from the first one: she takes her time.
<<set $r1_retry_again to false>>
<<done R1Dinner2Retry wait>>
<<wait 1>>
// She kisses him. Slower this time. Her hand on his chest, not on his wrist.
// PLACEHOLDER: kiss art, later.
<<wait 1>>
{$samantha_name}: That's better.
You: ...
{$samantha_name}: You learn.
{$samantha_name}: Goodnight, neighbour. Sleep. I'll know if you don't.
// She goes back in; he goes home.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaHome>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<wait 1>>
<<face Player up>>
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player down>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<wait 1>>
You: She kissed me like she had all night.
<<note r1_retry "Go to bed.">>
// The player is in control in 3B. Going to bed starts the next box (bed_3b.yarn).
===
title: Route1RetryReach
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by reaching for her again at her door (samantha_3a.yarn): she ends the evening
// again. The exit "again" enters this box once more, so it starts fresh.
<<done R1Dinner2Retry reach>>
// She catches his wrist and puts his hand back by his side.
{$samantha_name}: No.
{$samantha_name}: Twice. I thought you were quicker than that.
{$samantha_name}: Goodnight.
// She steps back through her door and closes it.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaHome>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<wait 1>>
You: ...Tomorrow, then.
<<set $r1_retry_again to true>>
<<fade_out>>
<<done R1Dinner2Retry again>>
===
